LONGSHOT — *charge and release*

**Verb:** crank to charge a power bar. **Release A** to commit.

The classic Track & Field / golf power meter, except the bar is **distance price must travel** and the
payout scales with how far you cranked. Over-crank and you'll never touch it.

```
  LONGSHOT
   ┌────────────────────────────┐
   │████████████████░░░░░░░░░░░░│  +1.4%
   └────────────────────────────┘
        HOLD A · RELEASE TO FIRE
              PAYS 6.8x
```

**Real primitive:** a one-touch / knock-in option — *does price touch +X% within 60s?* A genuine exotic,
and the power bar is the most natural interface anyone has ever put on one.

---